 "id": "mk-c5-1",
 "src": "估價_綜合模擬卷五.html",
 "idx": 0,
 "group": "land",
 "q_html": "一、試依「不動產估價技術規則」說明土地開發分析法之意義、估價程序及價格公式。某開發案資料：預期總銷售金額100,000萬元，直接成本（營造施工費）36,000萬元，間接成本9,000萬元，適當利潤率15%，資本利息年利率4%，土地價值比率60%、建物價值比率40%，開發年數2年。試求資本利息綜合利率及土地開發分析價格。（25分）",
 "ans_html": "<div class=\"ans-block\">\n        <h4>一、意義（§70）</h4>\n        <p>土地開發分析法，指根據土地法定用途及使用強度，進行開發或建築所需之成本推算，估算開發或建築後之總銷售金額，扣除直接成本、間接成本、資本利息及利潤後，求得開發前或建築前之土地價格。所求得之價格為<strong>土地開發分析價格</strong>。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ans-block\">\n        <h4>二、估價程序（§71）</h4>\n        <ol>\n          <li>確定土地開發內容及預期開發時間</li>\n          <li>調查各項成本及相關費用並蒐集市場行情等資料</li>\n          <li>現況勘察並進行環境發展程度之調查及分析</li>\n          <li>估算開發後可銷售之土地或建物面積</li>\n          <li>估算開發或建築後總銷售金額</li>\n          <li>估算開發或建築所需各項成本及相關費用</li>\n          <li>選擇適當之利潤率及資本利息綜合利率</li>\n          <li>計算土地開發分析價格</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ans-block\">\n        <h4>三、價格公式（§81）</h4>\n        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">V</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">S</span><span class=\"kf-op\">÷</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">(1＋R)</span><span class=\"kf-op\">÷</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">(1＋i)</span><span class=\"kf-op\">－</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">(C＋M)</span></div></div>        <p>V＝土地開發分析價格；S＝開發或建築後總銷售金額；R＝適當利潤率；i＝資本利息綜合利率；C＝直接成本（營造或施工費）；M＝間接成本（規劃設計費、廣告銷售費、管理費、稅捐及其他負擔）。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ans-block\">\n        <h4>四、資本利息綜合利率（§79）</h4>\n        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">i</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">年利率</span><span class=\"kf-op\">×</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">（土地價值比率 ＋ 建物價值比率 × 1/2）</span><span class=\"kf-op\">×</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">開發年數</span></div></div>        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">i</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">4%</span><span class=\"kf-op\">×</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">（0.6 ＋ 0.4 × 1/2）</span><span class=\"kf-op\">×</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">2</span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">4%</span><span class=\"kf-op\">×</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">0.8</span><span class=\"kf-op\">×</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">2</span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\"><strong>6.4%</strong></span></div></div>        <p>建物資金係陸續投入，平均占用約半期，故建物價值比率乘 1/2；土地資金自始占用，不打折。若題目給資金來源比例，預售收入之資金不計息（§59）。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ans-block\">\n        <h4>五、代入計算</h4>\n        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">S</span><span class=\"kf-op\">÷</span><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">(1＋R)</span><span class=\"kf-op\">÷</span><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">(1＋i)</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">100,000</span><span class=\"kf-op\">÷</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">1.15</span><span class=\"kf-op\">÷</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">1.064</span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\"><strong>81,726 萬元</strong></span></div></div>        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">C</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＋</span><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">M</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">36,000</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＋</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">9,000</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">45,000 萬元</span></div></div>        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">V</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">81,726</span><span class=\"kf-op\">－</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">45,000</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\"><strong>36,726 萬元</strong></span></div></div>        <p>結論：該開發案之土地開發分析價格約為 36,726 萬元。（考試時依題目所給數字與取位為準。）</p>\n      </div>"
}